<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-WORLD YOUTH CHAMPIONSHIP SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD YOUTH CHAMPIONSHIP SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the second round</p>
<p>matches at the World Youth soccer championship on Thursday:</p>
<p>Japan 1 Australia 0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Atsushi Yanagisawa 43</p>
<p> Ghana	3  United Arab Emirates 0  (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Richard John Ackon 33, Baba Sule 80, Awudu Issaka</p>
<p>88.</p>
<p> Argentina  2  England		  1  (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Argentina - Riquelme Roman 10 pen, Aimar Pablo 26</p>
<p>England - Jamie Carragher 48</p>
<p> Spain	2  Canada		   0 (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Deus 74, Rivera 88</p>
<p>Quarter-finals (to be played June 29):</p>
<p>Uruguay v France (in Shah Alam)</p>
<p>Argentina v Brazil (in Kuching)</p>
<p>Spain v Ireland (in Shah Alam)</p>
<p>Japan v Ghana (in Johor Bahru)</p>
</text>
